# Build context for Dockerfile.fleet is the repo root, but the image only COPYs
# lab/skeleton, lab/tests, lab/pytest.ini. Exclude everything heavy or secret so
# `gcloud builds submit .` uploads a small, secret-free context.

# Dependencies / build artifacts
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/venv

# VCS / tooling
.git
.gitignore
.claude
.harness

# Secrets / local env — NEVER ship into a build context
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.vercel
**/*-secret
**/.worker-secret

# Not needed by the fleet image
web
docs
control-plane
scripts
*.md
